1
00:00:00,470 --> 00:00:03,706
Every evil lab needs
a self-destruct button.

2
00:00:03,746 --> 00:00:05,495
Two red buttons.

3
00:00:05,535 --> 00:00:07,826
...Are you smiling?

4
00:00:07,866 --> 00:00:09,034
No.

5
00:00:09,074 --> 00:00:12,112
Don't touch it.
I'm getting coffee.

6
00:00:16,797 --> 00:00:19,486
Which one is the self-destruct?

7
00:00:19,526 --> 00:00:21,127
One of them.

8
00:00:21,597 --> 00:00:23,929
Cleo. Put it down.

9
00:00:24,899 --> 00:00:27,310
I never built
an abort button!

10
00:00:30,299 --> 00:00:32,960
...Technically, it worked.

11
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:35,097
Build another one.
